LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_1::
	.string "Ah, you have a MAGIKARP! Let’s\n"
	.string "see how big that baby is.$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_2::
	.string "LAKE OF RAGE is actually a crater\n"
	.string "made by rampaging GYARADOS.\p"
	.string "The crater filled up with rainwater\n"
	.string "and the LAKE was formed.\p"
	.string "That’s the story passed on from my\n"
	.string "Grandpa’s great-great-grandpa.\p"
	.string "It used to be that you could catch\n"
	.string "lively MAGIKARP there, but...\p"
	.string "I don’t understand what’s happening.$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_4::
	.string "What? That’s not a MAGIKARP!$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_5::
	.string "Let me measure that MAGIKARP.\p"
	.string "...Hm, it measures {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
	.string "Wow! This one is outstanding!\p"
	.string "...I wish I could say that, but I’ve\n"
	.string "seen a bigger one before.$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_6::
	.string "Let me measure that MAGIKARP.\p"
	.string "...Hm, it measures {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
	.string "Wow! This one is outstanding!\p"
	.string "I tip my hat to you!\p"
	.string "Take this as a memento!$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_7::
	.string "The record is the important thing.\n"
	.string "Think of that as a bonus!$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_8::
	.string "Let me measure that MAGIKARP.\p"
	.string "...Hm, it measures {STR_VAR_2}.\p"
	.string "I’ve seen a MAGIKARP with the same\n"
	.string "size.\p"
	.string "Are you sure it isn’t that same\n"
	.string "MAGIKARP?$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Fisher_9::
	.string "The LAKE hasn’t been normal since\n"
	.string "those men wearing black arrived.$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Sign_1::
	.string "It’s a blank chart of some sort.\p"
	.string "It has spaces for writing in\n"
	.string "records of some kind.$"

LakeOfRage_Interior1_Text_Sign_2::
	.string "The biggest HERACROSS that I have\n"
	.string "ever seen measured so far is:\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_3} inches!$"
